"Set exact endpoint" = "设置确切端点";
"Clear endpoint — local LanceDB only" = "清除端点——仅适用于本地 LanceDB";
"No embedded credentials, query or fragment" = "不得包含凭据、查询参数或片段";
"Keep existing embedding profile" = "保留现有嵌入配置";
