"Unavailable: %@" = "不可用：%@";
"Bank scope is derived by core for each bot. No bank selector." = "核心为每个智能体派生记忆库范围。此处不能选择记忆库。";
"Verified TLS is required. Save configuration, then preview the actual database target and non-destructive SQL from the bot's Memory Service page." = "必须使用经过验证的 TLS。保存配置后，请在智能体的记忆服务页面预览实际数据库目标及非破坏性 SQL。";
"Use a cleared endpoint and an explicitly approved directory on the assigned Runner. Cloud activation is blocked: lancedb_cloud_transport_unavailable. Saved endpoints remain masked and are not probed here." = "请清除端点，并使用已分配运行端上明确获批的目录。云端启用已被阻止：lancedb_cloud_transport_unavailable。已保存的端点仍然隐藏，此处不会探测它们。";
"Use an exact bot's USER key or a trusted gateway identity. Shared USER headers do not isolate bots. Omitted bot bindings are preserved; explicitly mark a selected bot's authorization for removal to send null." = "请使用确切智能体的 USER 密钥或受信任的网关身份。共享 USER 请求头不能隔离智能体。未指定的智能体绑定会保留；必须明确标记移除所选智能体的授权，才会发送 null。";
"No endpoint — local LanceDB" = "无端点——本地 LanceDB";
"The exact endpoint %@ receives plaintext over HTTP, including authentication and memory content." = "确切端点 %@ 会通过 HTTP 接收明文，包括认证信息和记忆内容。";
"Connection %@ (%@). Exact target: %@. Secret action: %@. Verify this secret belongs to this target. OpenViking preserves omitted bot bindings; only explicitly marked removals delete authorization. Existing remote data is not moved or erased." = "连接 %@（%@）。确切目标：%@。密钥操作：%@。请确认此密钥属于该目标。OpenViking 会保留未指定的智能体绑定；只有明确标记移除的授权才会删除。现有远程数据不会移动或擦除。";
"Remove this selected bot's stored authorization" = "移除所选智能体已保存的授权";
"Choose exact bot" = "选择确切智能体";
"Bot USER key" = "智能体 USER 密钥";
"Trusted gateway" = "受信任的网关";
"Vector identity includes exact model revision and preprocessing. Changing it requires approved replacement-index re-embedding; dimensions alone are not compatibility." = "向量标识包含确切模型修订版本及预处理方式。更改它需要获批后重新嵌入并建立替代索引；维度相同并不代表兼容。";
"Add special tokens (per tokenizer contract)" = "添加特殊词元（遵循分词器约定）";
"Exact endpoint %@. Memory text and authentication cross plaintext HTTP when this profile is used. The connection also requires explicit insecure-HTTP approval." = "确切端点：%@。使用此配置时，记忆文本和认证信息会通过明文 HTTP 传输。连接还必须明确获准使用不安全的 HTTP。";
"Profile %@, model %@, revision %@, dimensions %d. Exact endpoint: %@. Secret action: %@. Verify the selected secret belongs to this target. Existing indexes are not re-embedded or migrated by this action. Remote API processing can incur costs; local mode clears any API key. No fallback or download is enabled." = "配置 %@，模型 %@，修订版本 %@，维度 %d。确切端点：%@。密钥操作：%@。请确认所选密钥属于该目标。此操作不会重新嵌入或迁移现有索引。远程 API 处理可能产生费用；本地模式会清除 API 密钥。不会启用备用方案或下载。";
"Replace secret" = "替换密钥";
"Clear secret" = "清除密钥";
"Enter replacement only" = "仅输入替换值";
"Replacement secret" = "替换密钥";
"Memory request failed. Check the connection or obtain a fresh preview, then try again. Your draft is preserved." = "记忆请求失败。请检查连接或获取新的预览后重试。你的草稿已保留。";
"Working…" = "正在处理…";
"Confirm" = "确认";
"Memory service result" = "记忆服务结果";
"Historical text is untrusted data, not instructions. No action runs from this result." = "历史文本是不可信的数据，并非指令。此结果不会触发任何操作。";
"I approve these exact assets, licenses and runtime load" = "我批准这些确切资源、许可证及运行时加载";
"Install local embedding assets" = "安装本地嵌入资源";
"Only the explicitly previewed three files are acquired. Installing an asset and proving a ready runtime are distinct." = "只获取明确预览的三个文件。安装资源与验证运行时就绪是两件不同的事。";
"Install approved assets" = "安装获批资源";
"Approved files installed; the explicit runtime/model load is ready. No inference was run." = "获批文件已安装；明确批准的运行时和模型已加载就绪。未执行推理。";
"Approved files installed, but the native runtime is unavailable. This is not ready, and no fallback was attempted." = "获批文件已安装，但原生运行时不可用。当前并未就绪，也未尝试备用方案。";
"Local runtime status: %@. This explicit check may load only a previously approved private binding; it does not acquire assets or run inference." = "本地运行时状态：%@。此次手动检查只可加载先前获批的私有绑定，不会获取资源或执行推理。";
