"%d masked connections · %d embedding profiles. Readiness is checked per bot, not inferred from this list." = "%d 个隐藏敏感信息的连接 · %d 个嵌入配置。就绪状态按智能体检查，不会从此列表推断。";
"Disconnect %@ (%@) for this account and invalidate queued use. This does not erase its remote data." = "为此账户断开 %@（%@），并使队列中的使用请求失效。这不会擦除其远程数据。";
