"Bot %@; connection %@. Automatic recall: %@. Future conversation capture: %@. Group capture: %@. Capture cap: %d per admitted turn. The endpoint and downstream models receive plaintext and may charge you; no historical backfill, unattended retries or scheduled refresh is authorized." = "智能体 %@；连接 %@。自动检索：%@。记录今后对话：%@。记录群聊：%@。每个获准轮次最多投递 %d 次。端点及其下游模型会接收明文，并可能收费；未授权补录历史内容、无人值守重试或定时刷新。";
"Bot %@; connection %@. Send this text to the service and its downstream models; this may incur costs. Stable request IDs do not guarantee exactly-once billing.\n\n%@" = "智能体 %@；连接 %@。将此文本发送到服务及其下游模型可能产生费用。稳定的请求 ID 不能保证只计费一次。\n\n%@";
"Stored" = "已存储";
"Not confirmed stored" = "尚未确认已存储";
"Bot %@; connection %@. The query is plaintext. %@\n\n%@" = "智能体 %@；连接 %@。查询内容为明文。%@\n\n%@";
"Native reflect uses the service's models and may incur downstream costs. No schedule or background refresh is enabled." = "原生反思使用服务的模型，可能产生下游费用。未启用定时任务或后台刷新。";
"Search can invoke paid embeddings or reranking." = "搜索可能调用付费嵌入或重排序服务。";
"No durable deliveries reported." = "未报告持久化投递记录。";
"\nDeletion remains pending — not verified erasure." = "\n删除仍待完成——尚未验证擦除。";
"\nRetry may incur another service charge; cancellation is not verified deletion." = "\n重试可能再次产生服务费用；取消并不代表已验证删除。";
"Bot %@; connection %@ (%@), revision %llu · %@; deletion epoch %llu. Target: %@. This fences queued writes; pending cleanup does not mean erasure. Service backups and Lance history may retain data." = "智能体 %@；连接 %@（%@），修订版本 %llu · %@；删除世代 %llu。目标：%@。这会隔离队列中的写入；清理待完成并不代表已擦除。服务备份及 Lance 历史可能保留数据。";
"Deletion pending. Remote quiescence/erasure is not verified." = "删除待完成。尚未验证远程操作已停止或数据已擦除。";
