"Deletion epoch %llu. %@" = "删除世代 %llu。%@";
"Advanced memory controls" = "高级记忆服务控制";
"Typed, bot-bound actions for negotiated capabilities only. No bank, account, tenant, URI, table or credential selector." = "仅提供已协商能力中绑定智能体的类型化操作。不提供记忆库、账户、租户、URI、数据表或凭据选择器。";
